  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Thinly slice brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic. </li>\n• <li>Slice cucumber into thin sticks. Grate carrot. </li>\n• <li>In a large bowl, combine carrot and salad leaves. Drizzle with white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season and toss to coat. </li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b73566fff2efa4150deb7c/step-41c50800.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. </li>\n• <li>Cook onion, stirring regularly until softened, 5-6 mins. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 min. </li>\n• <li>Reduce heat to medium. Stir in the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 mins. Transfer to a small bowl.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b73566fff2efa4150deb7c/step-8504d010.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Pat haloumi dry with paper towel, then cut into 1cm-thick slices. </li>\n• <li>In a medium bowl, combine haloumi, chermoula spice blend and a drizzle of olive oil. Toss to coat. </li>\n• <li>Wipe out the frying pan and heat over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 mins each side. Cook in batches if necessary. Drizzle with the honey and toss to coat. Remove pan from heat.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b73566fff2efa4150deb7c/step-550d0120.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <ul>\n• <li>Meanwhile, microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through. </li>\n• <li>Build tacos by spreading a layer of the mayonnaise on each tortilla. </li>\n• <li>Top with salad, caramelised onion, cucumber and haloumi to serve.</li>\n• </ul>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69b73566fff2efa4150deb7c/step-3fc35730.jpeg"
    }
  ]
